    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Moovingo are delighted to present this superb end-of-terrace home to the market. Measuring an impressive 150 Sq.M / 1,615 Sq.Ft, having been extended on different occasions over the years, the house offers a large amount of living space and would be ideal for a growing family. The house has been lovingly maintained by generations of the same family and comes to market in good condition throughout.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises a wide entrance hallway, front living room, kitchen, large dining room, shower room, and bright conservatory. Upstairs there are 3 bedrooms, master with significant wardrobe space, and a family bathroom. The property has a low maintenance stone garden at front and rear, with the rear garden enjoying a sunny south-east orientation. There is off-street parking at the front with space for a car in the driveway and ample free parking on the road also. The beautiful surrounds of Stardust Memorial Park are just a minute away at the end of the road.\r\n\r\nArea Info\r\n\r\nThe property enjoys an enviable location close to a number of local amenities including shops, restaurants, bars, cafés and leisure centres. Northside Shopping Centre (with Dunnes Stores) is just a short walk away, while Aldi is also a short walk in the opposite direction. There are a great selection of primary and secondary schools in the area in addition to multiple childcare facilities. There are numerous sporting clubs in the vicinity and Stardust Memorial Park is just a short stroll away.\r\n\r\nThe property is conveniently located for transport links with multiple bus routes operating nearby (including the no.27), the M50/M1 just a short drive away and Dublin Airport also within easy reach."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Superb End-of-Terrace Home\r\nExtended to 150 Sq.M. / 1,615 Sq.FT.\r\nGood Condition Throughout\r\nSunny South-East Facing Garden\r\nLarge Master Bedroom\r\nMature Residential Area\r\nStardust Memorial Park |"
      },
